; ======== EngOut_Scheduler  (@0xa9592) ========
        ; ------------------------------------------------------------
        ; Engine output ISR (identified by HW interrupt vector + CAPCOM/channel registers): Engine 4-channel
        ; output-event SCHEDULER: advances per-channel state machines switch(f59b/f59c/f59d/f59e) via jump
        ; tables @0x6526/653a/654e/... (the CapCom_CC0..CC3_Drv arms), schedules CAPCOM compare events
        ; (CCM/CCxIC) from eoi/angle timing + accumulators fa12/14/16/18. Computed-jump -> MCP decompiler
        ; fails.
        ; ------------------------------------------------------------
EngOut_Scheduler:
